ves as a pilot solution developed within the framework of the Interreg Central Europe project VReduMED (CE0100136).", "short_description": "VReduMed-VRoomOfHorror is a virtual reality training application designed to help nursing students and healthcare trainees practice identifying clinical and environmental errors in a simulated patient room.  The application serves as a pilot solution developed within the framework of the Interreg Central Europe project VReduMED (CE0100136)."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ddc.sze.hu/adatvedelmi-tajekoztato/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sz\u00e9chenyi Istv\u00e1n University, Digital Development Center", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ddc.sze.hu/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "478089301798119"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "31605138639131530"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823837_866315932976280_9126631463882894823_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m8IBOA9psLsQ7kNvwHr5cfh&_nc_oc=AdqpzN7KMsVktXyaNmG1J5Ylq5yrFWRZ27hqaxfB9NoFhc6Diq5kOQXWJX3YvJLgeE0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSFz8gDYkwbB6chSzLLSgng0vF8vS0EsuKl-affsGSTlg&oe=6B0B15D5"}, "